# Media and catalog

## On-disk layout

```
# Menswear — nested by collection
public/media/menswear/{collection-slug}/set-{n}/*.jpg

# Womenswear — product sets live directly under the category (no nested collection folder)
public/media/womenswear/set-{n}/*.jpg
```

## Generated vs hand-authored

| Path                                     | Edit?                                         |
| ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| `generated/media-manifest.ts`            | Never — run `npm run generate:media`          |
| `generated/product-catalog.generated.ts` | Never — run `npm run generate:media`          |
| `constants/collections.ts`               | Yes — collection metadata (`COLLECTION_DEFS`) |

## Workflow

1. Add/rename folders under `public/media/`.
2. Run `npm run normalize:media:apply` if folder names need slug normalization.
3. Run `npm run generate:media`.
4. Run `npm run build`.

Product folders use sequential names: `set-1`, `set-2`, … Auto titles: "Kurta Set 1", "Sherwani Set 1", etc.
